  unitName: Phoena
  unitId: 60794
  unitNumber: 1067
  description: A young lady from another world guided by the Chain Chronicle. Having
    lost her memories, Phoena carried with her a single mysterious book that somehow
    led her to be targeted by the Black Army. Though a bit of an airhead and naive
    about the ways of the world, she has the ability to see the true essence of all
    things. This, combined with her strong core, encouraged Phoena to fight in the
    frontlines with her friends from the Volunteer Army to make their ideal future
    a reality. It is said that whenever Phoena's comrades hear her affectionate voice
    cheering for them on the battlefield, it raises their morale, as well as abates
    the damage they suffer in action.
  summonDesc: I don't know<br>if I can be of any assistance...<br>But I will definitely
    do my best!
  fusionDesc: I want to become stronger.<br>I want to smile with everyone<br>until
    the very end.
